# rmarkdown::render_site() staging directory
Rmarkdown/www/

# Generated site output at the repository root. Removed on 2026-08-11 when the
# site moved to being built by CI; the live site is now whatever
# .github/workflows/build-site.yml publishes, never what is committed here.
#
# These patterns exist because Rmarkdown/000_render_site.R still shell-copies
# www/ up into the root, so anyone running the old local build recreates all of
# it. Ignored rather than deleted-and-forgotten, so it cannot silently come back.
/*.html
/*_files/
/site_libs/
/SiteResources/

